This is a great spoiler, but let me suggest a slight variation on it.
Don't bother engraving with gems.  Just name ALL your gems "worthless",
put them in a chest and kick away.  After a dozen or so kicks, all 
the really worthless ones will be gone.  Remove the remaining ones,
and rename them "valuable".

